876,0.025829674676060677,0.05613399296998978,0.05407572537660599,0.012075556442141533,-0.0068274326622486115,-0.04922733083367348],"metadata":{"id":"63a8d63a-c243-491b-a2f9-57f882695ed0","url":"file:///app/collector/hotdir/MCP Backup and Recovery Strategy.md","title":"MCP Backup and Recovery Strategy.md","docAuthor":"Unknown","description":"Unknown","docSource":"a text file uploaded by the user.","chunkSource":"","published":"7/4/2025, 6:37:19 AM","wordCount":146,"token_count_estimate":194,"text":"<document_metadata>\nsourceDocument: MCP Backup and Recovery Strategy.md\npublished: 7/4/2025, 6:37:19 AM\n</document_metadata>\n\n# MCP System Backup Strategy - Protecting AI Assistant Data\n\n## User Concern\n- Python crash was scary - what if system fails completely?\n- Want to backup all MCP tools, memories, configurations\n- Ensure AI assistant setup can be restored elsewhere\n\n## What Needs Backing Up\n1. **MCP Tool Configurations**\n   - Tool installations and settings\n   - Project configurations \n   - Custom workflows\n\n2. **Memory Files**\n   - All written memories from conversations\n   - Project-specific knowledge\n   - Learning and preferences\n\n3. **System Integration**\n   - MCP server configurations\n   - Permission settings\n   - Tool connections\n\n## Backup Strategy Ideas\n- External drive backup of MCP data\n- Cloud storage for memory files\n- Documentation of setup process\n- Export/import capabilities for configurations\n\n## Goal\n- Peace of mind that AI assistant setup is recoverable\n- Ability to restore full functionality on new system\n- Protection against system failures"}}]]